---

The keyboard layout data in the `data/` directory (layout, combination rules,
abbreviations, symbol compositions and candidates) is derived from the Semo-e
keyboard by Sinseiki (https://github.com/Sinseiki/Semo-e_keyboard) and is
licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International
License (CC BY-SA 4.0), not the MIT License above. See data/README.md.
Binaries built from this repository embed that data.
